            </note>
            <note corresp="#d689-f2" n="2" xml:id="d689-f2-content">
                <p>Instruction 27, June 20, authorized Minister Lawson to initiate the negotiations
                    on the basis of the military requirements outlined in <ref target="#d687"
                        >Document 687</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d689-f3" n="3" xml:id="d689-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed. (711.56340B/11–2451)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d689-f4" n="4" xml:id="d689-f4-content">
                <p>Reference is to NAOR/32 CC/50, Nov. 16, 1950, not printed, but see <ref
                        target="#d687">Document 687</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
